      ],
      "content": "LYE GREEN ROAD 1. 967                                            Brockhurst Farmhouse SP 90 SE 5/273 II                         GV 2. Cl7 or earlier (probably circa 1600) altered.  Red brick ground floor, timber framed 1st floor, tiled roof, plaster infilling, central gable.  1 storey and attics, gabled casement dormer.  Ground floor casements, gabled modern timber porch, tiled. V.C.H., III, 205. R.C.H.M. Bucks, I, 98. Brockhurst farmhouse and granary form a group. Listing NGR: SP9763502864"
    }
